Package: gnome-console
Version: @DEB_GNOME-CONSOLE_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: X11/Wayland Apps
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/console
Depends: libglib2.0-0, libgtk-4-1, libadwaita-1-0, libvte-2.91-gtk4-0, libpcre2-8-0, libgtop-2.0-11, dbus
Description: Simple user-friendly terminal emulator (GTK4)
 GNOME Console (kgx) is the modern GTK4/libadwaita terminal for GNOME. Runs as a
 plain X11 client under any window manager.
